message: >-
  If you reference or build on the methods, evidence chain, or
  negative-control framing in this repository, please cite it as below.
title: "Gnosis Cuneiform: Negative-Control Preservation Lane"
abstract: >-
  gnosis-cuneiform is a negative-control / control-pack repository inside the
  Zer0pa Gnosis Portfolio. It preserves the cuneiform benchmark/control
  artefact chain, the failed governing gate (NO_GO_GOVERNING_GATE_UNMET at
  governing_1nn_accuracy = 0.021916), and a stdlib-only manifest-validation
  smoke surface. Methodology only; no decipherment claim.
